                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today we celebrate 60 years of Medicaid and Medicare, lifelines for our communities. I hosted a roundtable with providers like DAP Health, Innercare, and St. John\u2019s who shared heartbreaking stories of how the Big Ugly Law will gut health care for 427,700 neighbors in #CA25.\n\nWe must stay united and work together to meet our community\u2019s needs.",
