                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I met with Alejandro Espinoza, Chief of Community Engagement at Desert Healthcare District @DesertHealthCV, to discuss the harm Medicaid cuts pose to our region.\n\nFrom preventive care to critical treatments, Medicaid keeps families healthy and communities strong. These reckless cuts put lives at risk.",
