                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I spoke with David Brinkman, CEO of DAP Health, about how the Big Ugly Law passed by Trump and Congressional Republicans threatens Medicaid coverage for vulnerable individuals and families in our communities.\n\u00a0\nHearing directly from health leaders and partnering together are an essential part of protecting the people who depend on life-saving care like Medicaid.",
