                "reply_count": 2,
                "retweet_count": 8,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Make no mistake, Republicans will continue to look for ways to break Medicaid, Medicare, and the Affordable Care Act to free up billions in tax breaks for billionaires. \n\n15 million Americans will lose health care under the Big Ugly Law that they just passed, which cuts over $1 trillion from Medicaid and the Affordable Care Act.",
