                "reply_count": 7,
                "retweet_count": 7,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Social Security, Medicare, and Medicaid are promises and essential for tens of millions of Americans. But President Trump and Congressional Republicans have passed their Big Ugly Law, with no sign of lower costs for the people.\n\nTheir agenda is simple: put the billionaires first, and if that comes at higher costs for everyone else, so be it.",
