                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "As a doctor, I know that detecting cancer early saves lives.\n\nThat\u2019s why I\u2019m an original co-sponsor of the Nancy Gardner Sewell Medicare Multi-Cancer Early Detection Screening Coverage Act, to ensure Medicare covers innovative screenings that improve early diagnosis and help more patients beat cancer.",
