                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I\u2019m taking a few moments during this busy fight to open the government, protect health care, and to recognize the physicians who care for their patients and defend Medicaid. That\u2019s why today we honor #NationalLatinoandLatinaPhysicianDay.",
